# Engagement ROI model — {{CLIENT_NAME}}

Enter the figures from the operating map. **Use conservative inputs — a defensible number beats an impressive one.**

A G3 criterion is a **measured** outcome, not a projected one. Baselines were captured in stage 04 while the current state was still observable; this model populates with **actuals** against them.

